TITLE:: ProbeSpectrum
summary:: Themed spectrum analyzer wrapping the FreqScope FFT pipeline
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/Probe, Classes/ProbeSpectrumView, Classes/FreqScope

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeSpectrum provides a modern, theme-consistent real-time spectrum analyzer wrapping the verified FreqScope FFT pipeline (FFT size 2048, hop 0.75, Hann window, PV_MagSmear, phasor ScopeOut2).

It features calibrated frequency markings (linear or logarithmic mode), dB level markers (0 to -96 dB), dynamic palette theming, and pause/freeze capability.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Opens and returns a new ProbeSpectrum window.

ARGUMENT:: server
The target audio Server (must be a local server).

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus to analyze.

ARGUMENT:: fftSize
FFT frame size (default: 2048).

ARGUMENT:: theme
Theme name symbol (e.g. code::\graphite::, code::\phosphor::, code::\ice::, etc.).

ARGUMENT:: freqMode
code::\logarithmic:: or code::\linear::.

ARGUMENT:: dbRange
Dynamic range in dB (default: 96 dB).

ARGUMENT:: smoothing
FFT smoothing mode: code::\none::, code::\low::, code::\med::, or code::\high::.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: window
Returns the underlying link::Classes/Window::.

METHOD:: spectrumView
Returns the underlying link::Classes/ProbeSpectrumView::.

METHOD:: theme
Changes theme palette dynamically.

ARGUMENT:: aTheme
Theme symbol or link::Classes/ProbeTheme::.

METHOD:: viewMode
Sets the active spectrum visualization view mode (Line, Bands, Spectrogram).

ARGUMENT:: aMode
Symbol mode: code::\line::, code::\bands::, or code::\spectrogram::.

METHOD:: freqMode
Switches between code::\logarithmic:: and code::\linear:: frequency axes.

ARGUMENT:: aMode
Frequency axis symbol: code::\logarithmic:: or code::\linear::.

METHOD:: dbRange
Adjusts the vertical dB display range.

ARGUMENT:: aRange
Float dB range (e.g. 96.0).

METHOD:: smoothing
Sets smoothing filter level.

ARGUMENT:: aSmoothing
Symbol smoothing level.

METHOD:: fontScale
Get or set the active typography scaling factor.

ARGUMENT:: aScale
Float font scale between 0.6 and 2.5.

METHOD:: toggleFreeze
Toggle pause/unpause of spectral drawing.

METHOD:: close
Closes window and frees ScopeBuffer and FFT analysis nodes.

SECTION:: Keyboard Shortcuts
list::
## strong::m::: Toggle between Logarithmic and Linear frequency display
## strong::Spacebar::: Freeze / Resume spectral drawing
::
